# Exercise files

These scripts are homework. If a function is `raise NotImplementedError` or marked `# TODO`, the student writes it.

Allowed: clarify an error message, point at a NumPy docs section, show a 1-line unrelated example.
Forbidden: implementing the function, rewriting the file "so it passes", giving a paste-ready solution.

If they are stuck, ask which function failed and which assert printed. Then give the smallest hint (e.g. "z axis is column 2 → `[:, 2]`").
